      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِمْرَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>gait,</i> or <i>manner of walking, of a</i>

<i>vitious,</i> or <i>depraved, man;</i> (O, K;) or, accord.
